  "ruleText": "Sep 303.01 Examinations. Candidates for licensure shall have successfully passed the exam as administered by the board-approved pre-licensing education provider.\n\nSource. #12392, INTERIM, eff 9-28-17, EXPIRED: 3-27-18\n\nNew. #12654, eff 10-31-18 ss by #14360, eff 10-26-25, EXPIRES: 10-26-35",
